+
+
+if __name__ == "__main__":
+    print(json.dumps(selftest(), indent=2, sort_keys=True))

codex
The first implementation is in place and produces valid native witnesses across all four presets. I’m now stress-testing the construction-aware attacks and the compact route. The initial generator is conservative—it rejects candidates that any cheap attack solves—so I’m also measuring build time and will simplify the screen if it costs more than the hardness evidence justifies.
