Two independent bare `easy` instances have now defeated the two-vendor pool. The final attempt uses another fresh seed; if it also fails, `easy` is the hardened level and I’ll slide `SHIPPING_DIFFICULTY` down from the provisional `medium` to match the script-owned verdict, then rerun every local gate at that actual shipping preset.
