The third `easy` oracle solved its instance, so the harness correctly escalated to `medium`; the provisional shipping choice was justified. The first `medium` attempt is now running. If all three medium instances fail, no ladder rewrite is needed.
diff --git a/gen_1710_04640.py b/gen_1710_04640.py
